{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"9660ba0cdf7a85dd0c454d771aaa4f6840387a8b07c58e63252424143df89379","digest":{"component_or_area":"JiraDataCenterTransport","key_entities":["JiraDataCenterTransport","get_issuelinks_map","get_comment_map","get_parent_map","search_issues","_paged_search","max_results","start_at"],"problem_keywords":["pagination","silent truncation","unpaginated search","data loss","Jira Data Center"],"propositions":["get_issuelinks_map and get_comment_map silently truncate at 50 issues due to unpaginated search_issues calls with default max_results=50, losing all issues beyond the first page","The pager must advance by len(batch) and terminate only on an empty page, not on a short page, because Jira DC silently truncates maxResults above the configured maximum","A shared _paged_search helper must be extracted and used by all three whole-project readers (get_issuelinks_map, get_comment_map, get_parent_map) to prevent future instances of this defect class","Links and comments from issues beyond the first 50 are silently lost, causing the differ to emit spurious mutations and miss removals"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787536359292774001,"uuid":"0f687657-658f-46db-9c05-fd72e9f81d10"}